@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@placeId = ChIJ0zC-8N1qkFQRLC8kcIzkTPY
@takedownApiKey = dev-takedown-key

### Health check — overall
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Health check — liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health check — readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Diagnostics snapshot (masked keys + integration statuses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag

### Mock-data status
GET {{baseUrl}}/diag/mock-status

### Get current dev session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession

### Create anonymous guest session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession/anon

### Logout / clear dev session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/devsession

### Nearby restaurants by coordinates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/nearby?latitude=47.6062&longitude=-122.3321&limit=10

### Search restaurants by location text
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/search?location=Seattle%2C%20WA&limit=10

### Leaderboard (top N for a region)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard?region=US&limit=10

### Generate comic for a place
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/{{placeId}}?forceRegenerate=false

### Get cached comic for a place
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/comics/{{placeId}}

### Submit takedown request (requires X-Api-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/takedowns
X-Api-Key: {{takedownApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placeId": "{{placeId}}",
  "requesterName": "Jane Doe",
  "contactEmail": "jane@example.com",
  "region": "US",
  "reason": "Owner request"
}
